The tab-completion engine, Get-GitStatus data API, argument-expansion
tables, and much of the module scaffolding are derived from the
upstream project and remain the work of the posh-git contributors. Their commit history is preserved in this
repository's git log; see the Contributors view on the hosting
platform for the full list.

Modifications in this fork (attributed to Taylor Jordan and any
subsequent contributors listed in git history):
  - Removed the built-in prompt renderer (posh-git's marquee feature).
  - Removed TortoiseGit integration (tgit command).
  - Removed VSTS / TFS tab-completion support.
  - Added workflow-shortcut cmdlets (Get-GitToolsHelp, Show-GitStatus,
    Switch-GitTrunk, Set-GitLocationRoot, New-GitBranch,
    Switch-GitBranch, New-GitCommit, Remove-GitStaleBranch,
    Sync-GitBranch, Remove-GitAliasCruft) with 'g-' aliases.
  - Added tab-completion filter for probe-pattern git aliases.
  - Modernized branch defaults (trunk/main over master).
  - Renamed the module to 'gee'.

The upstream posh-git project remains actively maintained by its
original authors and is the recommended module for users who want
the full prompt-rendering feature set.
